<title>USA: J.C.Penney names CEO Oesterreicher chairman.</title>
<headline>J.C.Penney names CEO Oesterreicher chairman.</headline>
<dateline>PLANO, Texas 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.C. Penney Co Inc said Wednesday it had elected Chief Executive James Oesterreicher as chairman, succeeding W.R. Howell, who is retiring in February.</p>
<p>Oesterreicher's appointment as chairman is effective at the close of business on January 8, 1997, the company said. He will continue to serve as chief executive.</p>
